// D-PERSIST1 — `#Persist` dev-hot-reload state survival.
// First plain `jet run` prints 1: `run()` increments the initial counter once.
// During `jet dev`, an unrelated edit reruns against surviving state, so the
// next print is 2. A binding shape change resets it from its new initializer.
// Plain `jet run` always starts fresh, so it always prints 1.
#Persist counter := 0

fn run() {
    counter += 1
    print("{counter}")
}
// --- expected output --------------------------------------------------
// 1
